&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Significant experience leading complex campaigns or customer opportunities within the Aerospace and Defence sector, with demonstratable ownership from early opportunity shaping through bid and contract award&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of Air domain missions, with particular emphasis is on manned airborne ISR. Experience across additional Air domain mission sets, such as Aerial Fire Fighting, Air to Air Refueling, or Strategic Transport and Mobility, is desirable&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
