&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong strategic and analytical skills, with the ability to interpret complex customer, market and competitive information and translate it into clear and actionable campaign strategy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Excellent written communication skills, with the ability to translate complex technical, operational and commercial information into clear, persuasive and customer-focused proposal content&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
