&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong communication and influencing skills, with the confidence and credibility to present, challenge and defend recommendations with senior internal and external stakeholders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
